    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n28483" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Mĕlĭē</span></b> ,
			ēs, or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Mĕlĭa</span></b> , ae,
		f., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Μελία</span>. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A sea-nymph</i>: Hestiaea, Melie, Ianthe, Hyg. Fab.
			praef.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A Bithynian nymph, beloved by the river-god
